## Bundled native components

- **FFmpeg 8.1.2** — LGPL-2.1-or-later, built **without** `--enable-gpl`
  and shipped as dynamically linked shared libraries (`libavcodec.so`,
  `libavformat.so`, `libavutil.so`, `libswresample.so`).
  - Source: <https://ffmpeg.org/>; the exact build is described by
    `scripts/build-ffmpeg-android.sh`.
  - The shared libraries can be replaced with compatible builds; no
    relinking against proprietary code is required.
  - License text: `licenses/LGPL-2.1.txt`.
- **OpenSSL 3.0.x** — Apache-2.0.
  - Source: <https://github.com/openssl/openssl>.
  - License text: `licenses/Apache-2.0.txt`.
- **ONNX Runtime 1.32.0** — MIT, built from source with a reduced operator and
  dtype configuration for CPU inference (`libonnxruntime.so`,
  `libonnxruntime4j_jni.so`).
  - Exact build configuration: `scripts/build-onnxruntime-android.sh` and
    `scripts/onnxruntime-required-ops.config`.

